## Fallback

For all quantitative claims and equations needed by the reproduction,
the human-digitized CSVs under `../data/` and the plain `paper.txt`
were sufficient — the reproduction runs end-to-end without a Nougat
parse. This stub exists so the parser bookkeeping is honest about
what has and has not been run.

To upgrade this stub to a real parse:
```
# On uicgpu (when GPU is idle):
scp paper.pdf uicgpu:/tmp/turner2019.pdf
ssh uicgpu 'cd ~/nougat && python -m nougat.predict /tmp/turner2019.pdf \
    -o /tmp/turner2019.mmd --model 0.1.0-base'
scp uicgpu:/tmp/turner2019.mmd extraction/nougat.mmd
```
